ADA-001","locale":"tl","turn":2,"field":"translation","before":"Kapag sundo, aalis sa gitna kaya near exit sana.","after":"Aalis ako sa kalagitnaan kapag dumating ang sasakyang susundo, kaya naghahanap ako ng upuang malapit sa labasan.","reason":"Replace telegraphic fragments with full dialogue retaining pickup, aisle-seat, phone and quiet-exit conditions.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/tl/224.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-SMN-HAMADA-001-SHARED-02"},{"scenarioId":"SC-SMN-HAMADA-001","locale":"tl","turn":3,"field":"translation","before":"Daan kailangang libre, sa bakanteng aisle seat.","after":"Kailangang panatilihing maluwag ang pasilyo, kaya ituturo ko ang bakanteng upuan sa tabi nito.","reason":"Replace telegraphic fragments with full dialogue retaining pickup, aisle-seat, phone and quiet-exit conditions.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/tl/224.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-SMN-HAMADA-001-SHARED-03"},{"scenarioId":"SC-SMN-HAMADA-001","locale":"tl","turn":4,"field":"translation","before":"Harap mukhang kita pero istorbo sa likod kapag tumayo.","after":"Mukhang mas malinaw sa harap, pero kung tatayo ako sa kalagitnaan, makakaabala ako sa mga nasa likod.","reason":"Replace telegraphic fragments with full dialogue retaining pickup, aisle-seat, phone and quiet-exit conditions.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/tl/224.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-SMN-HAMADA-001-SHARED-04"},{"scenarioId":"SC-SMN-HAMADA-001","locale":"tl","turn":5,"field":"translation","before":"Likod na ito, mas kaunting epekto.","after":"Sa upuang ito sa likod, mas kaunti ang maaabala sa paligid kapag tumayo kayo.","reason":"Replace telegraphic fragments with full dialogue retaining pickup, aisle-seat, phone and quiet-exit conditions.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/tl/224.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-SMN-HAMADA-001-SHARED-05"},{"scenarioId":"SC-SMN-HAMADA-001","locale":"tl","turn":6,"field":"translation","before":"Dito ako. Kapag tawag, sa labas puwedeng usap